      "reason": "Resolve missing objective and residual specifications before attributing gains to architecture.",
      "query": "SASRec uniform multi-negative candidate-set cross entropy negative count temperature duplicate negatives known-positive exclusion gSASRec objective ablation bounded residual gate initialization logit scale"
    },
